<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3ƆZHN - ELOYI TRANSLATION</book>
  <para style="h">3 Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu Ungwɔla Ungwu Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="toc3">3 Ɔzhn</para>
  <para style="mt">Kwupu Ungwɔla Ungwu Ɔzhɔnu</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu kwɔlɛ Onzu Uwakɔ Ɔzhɔnu gba a ka le laa u to keyi uwu ɔshɔshi uwu o ya wu tee Ogayusu awu. Onzu Uwakɔ Ɔzhɔnu a pwɔ Ogayusu ma kwuwongu imbwama iyi a mbwa laa Wambwalu. A za wu tee le gboshoshi mbala onzu uwu o ya wu tee Odiyotirefisu uwu e wo anya mbala wambwalu awu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Memi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu Iyemo (1-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔ Pwɔ Ogayusu Ma (5-8)</para>
  <para style="io1">O Kpa Odiyotirefisu Ari (9-10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔ Pwɔ Ɔdimɛtirusu Ma (11-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama Iyi Iso (13-15)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Imi Ɔzhɔnu onzu uwakɔ uwu ɔshɔshi gba mi yi mu kwupu kwɔlɛ ikama le, laa umɛza uwu idu mi Ɔgayɔ, uwu mi pwu idɛnyi wu ireyi.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Umɛza uwu idu mi, mii lɛ Ukpo te le shi ŋɔ okpara uwu ɛnwu kaa fya ɔnyɛ ma mu kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ wo, mate bɔkɔ luzɛ ŋɔ mbala Ɔzhizɔsi lu yi ɔnyɛ awu tayi. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Mi mwɔnyɛ gyɔɔ kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ɛmɛnɛ wa mbwalu umbafo o bo munɛ akwɛyi o za mi tee ŋɔ yi mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo imbwaluma marimari, Imi mi yitu tee, tayi gba ŋɔ yi mu iwomo le. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Kwuye ungwunanguna ɔnyɛ mi a ka ele ma mo, gba mi pwa te ɛmɛ mi o yi mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu ongbulolo ɔlɛ imbwaluma marimari.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Pwɔ Ogayusu Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Umɛza uwu idu mi, uŋɔ ŋɔ mbwama la ɛmɛnɛ wa mbwalu mu apula ikikɔ ikikɔ, agboga lala ŋɔ kyo ŋɔ mbwa mba ma tete, ɛlɛ i zɔ tee, ŋɔ kwu u mbwalu ureyi. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />Enzu umbafo mbo, o za nzu kinzu umba ɔshɔshi munɛ tee, lunyi lu pwu idɛnyi iyi wa mbwalu ireyi. kwuyengwu bɔkɔ enzu mbɔlɛ o bo fulomo kaa lo so mu ese iyifo awu, shɔɔkɔ la lu mbwa mba ma mu egbo ikpɛnyi moo ɛlɛ gba Ukpo a gyi le. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />Moo enzu mbɔlɛ o yi mu ese ifulama kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, ba o na kiya mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu wa mbwalu mo mo. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />I fa tee kinzu wa mbwalu la ki sa igɔ iyi enzu mbɔlɛ te ma kaa kinzu la ki kyo la ki lo ewo kyaa mbala mba kaa la ki zɔ enzu ɛduma iyi ongbulolo.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odiyotirofi Mbala Ɔdimɛtiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Imi mi kakwupu mi ka la wa mbwalu mu kwuse yi mekyi, Odiyotirofi uwu bɔkɔ a gyi i to keyi iyi Ɔshɔshi awu ba, e towo iso mi imbwaluma. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, gba mi bo mu kwuse yi, iyi bɔkɔ Odiyotirofi e yi mu iwomo le, mi so yi Ɔshɔshi gedegede. E so iso nzu iyira midu iyi enzu. Akwu ɛlɛ kɛɛkyi mo, ɛmanyi nzu wa mbwalu lala a ana mba mo, akwɛyi enzu umba Ɔshɔshi umba bɔkɔ o gyi te lo na mba lala a nyi mba ma, umba bɔkɔ o na mba awu lala a ramba ma mu ɔshɔshi.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Umɛza uwu idu mi, uŋɔ ki nyama kaa vɔngɔ ari iyira mo, ari iyesheshi gba vɔngɔ mbaa enzu le. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e wo iyeshi, i zɔ te onzu awu akwu umɛ Ukpo, onzu uwu e wo iyira ba, i zɔ te onzu awu e yi Ukpo mo ndii. <verse eid="3JN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Enzu lɛɛbi o yi mu iso isomo iyesheshi iyi Ɔdimɛtirɔ luzɛ wu lala akwu longbulolo, ɛlɛ i zɔ te uwu akwu onzu uweshi. Kinzu tete ki yi mu iso wu isomo iyesheshi, lunyi lu yitu te iyi bɔkɔ ki so le akwu ongbulolo.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnyi Igbɛlɛma Imbwambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Imi mi yi apula gyɔɔ iyi mi gyi te la mi ka yi, Imi ba mi gyi te la mi ka ŋa mu kwupu mbala keshi mo. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Imi mi shi egbo te mi nyɔ munyi ŋɔ afyi ɛlɛ. Akwɛyi ki so iso mbala esu.<verse eid="3JN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Ukpo le shi kaa ŋɔ mu oloto. Ɛmɛza ŋa mu ɔshɔshi munɛ lɛɛbi, o ye ŋɔ mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma. Ɛmɛza nzu lɛɛbi, gbɛlɛ mba ɛnyi kɛnyi kɛnyi.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>